BT /Helvetica-Bold 9.00 Tf 0.100 0.150 0.250 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 461.39 Tm (3.1 Problem Statement & Healthcare Importance) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 450.39 Tm (Cardiovascular diseases \(CVDs\) remain the leading contributor to global mortality, causing an estimated 17.9 million deaths) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 440.59 Tm (annually. Concurrently, chronic psychophysiological stress and autonomic nervous system \(ANS\) dysregulation--characterized) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 430.79 Tm (by prolonged sympathetic hyperactivity and suppressed parasympathetic vagal tone--is a recognized precursor to hypertension,) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 420.99 Tm (fatal arrhythmias, and ischemic heart failure. While conventional 12-lead Electrocardiography \(ECG\) and continuous Holter) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 411.19 Tm (monitors represent the clinical gold standard, their reliance on specialized analog differential amplifiers, high-impedance) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 401.39 Tm (instrumentation circuitry, skin-abrasive conductive gel, and adhesive electrodes creates severe logistical friction.) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 391.59 Tm (Consequently, cardiac risk monitoring remains episodic and hospital-bound. There is an urgent engineering imperative for) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.80 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 1 0 0 1 45.00 381.79 Tm (frictionless, zero-external-hardware cardiovascular monitoring systems that leverage ubiquitous mobile consumer devices.) Tj ET
