BT /Helvetica 7.60 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 1 0 0 1 55.00 727.29 Tm (al. \(2008\) and Jonathan & Leahy \(2010\). Modern studies confirm that green light \(520-540 nm\) provides the) Tj ET
BT /Helvetica 7.60 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 1 0 0 1 55.00 718.09 Tm (highest signal-to-noise ratio \(SNR\) due to the distinct absorption peak of oxyhemoglobin \(HbO2\).) Tj ET
