BT /Helvetica 7.60 Tf 0.250 0.300 0.350 rg 1 0 0 1 55.00 600.09 Tm (demonstrated that in stationary resting conditions, peak-to-peak intervals \(PPI\) derived from optical PPG) Tj ET
